<section id="ep-solve" aria-labelledby="eps-title">
  <div class="eps-wrap">
    <div class="eps-copy">
      <h2 id="eps-title">Watch Edupath build a clash-free timetable.</h2>
      <p>Every lesson is checked against teachers, rooms and classes as it is placed. When two things collide, Edupath moves one of them and tells you what caused it.</p>
      <ul class="eps-rules">
        <li><span class="eps-tag">Must</span><span>A teacher is never in two places at once.</span></li>
        <li><span class="eps-tag">Must</span><span>Labs and the computer room go only to lessons that need them.</span></li>
        <li><span class="eps-tag soft">Prefer</span><span>Spread heavy subjects across the week and avoid gaps in a class&rsquo;s day.</span></li>
      </ul>
      <button class="eps-btn" type="button" id="eps-go">Generate timetable</button>
      <div class="eps-stats">
        <div class="eps-stat"><b id="eps-n1">0</b><span>lessons placed</span></div>
        <div class="eps-stat"><b id="eps-n2">0</b><span>clashes caught and fixed</span></div>
        <div class="eps-stat ok"><b id="eps-n3">&ndash;</b><span>clashes in final timetable</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="eps-panel">
      <div class="eps-bar"><strong>Grade 10 &ndash; Term 3</strong><span>Sample school, 9 periods a day</span></div>
      <div class="eps-scroll">
        <div class="eps-grid" id="eps-grid" role="img" aria-label="Animated example of a weekly timetable for Grade 10 being filled in without clashes"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="eps-log" id="eps-log">Press Generate timetable to start.</div>
      <p class="eps-note">An illustration of how placement works, using sample data. Speed depends on the size of your school.</p>
      <div class="eps-sr" id="eps-sr" role="status"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
